<title>USA: West Virginia $50 mln deal won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>West Virginia $50 mln deal won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney &amp; Co said it won $50 million State of West Virginia infrastructure general obligation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.547 percent.</p>
